# Deep Investigation Phase 2 — Frontend Rules

## Read the plan FIRST

`docs/deep_investigations/phase2/PHASE2_MARKET_ANALYTICS.md` (index) → then `PHASE2_4_5_UI_RELATIONSHIPS.md` for UI specs.

## File organization

```
features/deep-investigation/
  api.ts              ← API client (add new endpoints here, don't create new api files)
  hooks.ts            ← React Query hooks (add here OR split to hooks/ folder if >300 lines)
  types.ts            ← Shared types (add here OR split to types/ folder if >200 lines)
  types/              ← Split types when types.ts grows: indicators.ts, relationships.ts
  hooks/              ← Split hooks when hooks.ts grows: useComputeIndicators.ts, etc.
  components/         ← One component per file, ~150 lines soft — extract subcomponents when long (even if single-use)
  pages/              ← Page-level components (detail page, list page)
```

## Component rules

- **~150 lines per component (soft)** — extract subcomponents when files grow; encapsulation over hitting a number (see `.cursorrules` §3).
- `IndicatorComparisonCard.tsx` — 3-level columns + entity breakdown. Reusable across tabs.
- `MarketAnalysisTab.tsx` — compute trigger + date picker + indicator grid. Container only.
- `EntityProfilePanel.tsx` — slide-over panel with all indicators for one entity.
- `RelationshipsTab.tsx` — entity relationship graph/table.

## Hooks pattern

```typescript
// Mutation: trigger compute
useComputeIndicators(scopeId) → useMutation + invalidateQueries

// Polling: compute status
useComputeStatus(scopeId, { enabled }) → useQuery with refetchInterval: 2000 while computing

// Data: indicator results
useIndicatorResults(scopeId, { enabled }) → useQuery, enabled only when completed
```

## i18n

- **DI workspace tabs** (detail page, notes, entities, etc.): `deepInvestigation_en.json` / `deepInvestigation_lv.json`, namespace `deepInvestigation`.
- **`features/deep-investigation/analytics/`** (CV / Benford / Bid Delta route): **`charts_en.json` / `charts_lv.json`**, `useTranslation('charts')`, keys under **`diagnosticViz.*`** — same as `AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` / `IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` **D-I18N**. Do not put new analytics chart strings only in `deepInvestigation`.

## Styling

ONLY `--tp-*` tokens. See `.cursorrules` section 3 for full color/border/focus rules.
Subject entities: highlight with `bg-[color:var(--tp-warning-subtle)]` or similar token.
Threshold breach: red = `var(--tp-danger)`, green = `var(--tp-success)`.
